Package: irps
Type: Package
Title: Immune Response Potential Scoring for Immunotherapy Biomarker Evaluation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Maynard", , ,
           email = "maynard@example.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = ""))
  )
Description: Computes the Immune Response Potential Score (IRPS) from
    proteomics or transcriptomics data to evaluate PD-1/PD-L1 immunotherapy
    response potential. The package provides 18 curated immune gene sets,
    single-sample GSEA-based scoring, a 7-dimension immune microenvironment
    portrait decomposition, and immune phenotype classification (Inflamed /
    Excluded / Desert) adapted from Chen & Mellman (Nature, 2017). Designed
    for body-fluid proteomics but compatible with any normalized expression
    matrix. Includes comprehensive visualization functions and optional
    MSigDB Hallmark validation.
